# Frontend PRODUCTION environment (example).
#
# On Render you set VITE_API_BASE in the Static Site's Environment tab, or in
# render.yaml. This file just documents the one variable the frontend needs.
#
# IMPORTANT: anything prefixed VITE_ is embedded into the built JavaScript and is
# therefore PUBLIC. Never put a secret in a VITE_ variable. The frontend holds no
# secrets — only the public URL of the backend API.

# The HTTPS URL of your backend Web Service on Render (or a custom domain).
VITE_API_BASE=https://night-shift-backend.onrender.com
